MSX emulation: WebMSX (https://github.com/ppeccin/WebMSX) C-BIOS embedded build.
C-BIOS is an open-source MSX BIOS replacement, distributed under the
2-clause BSD license (https://cbios.sourceforge.net/).
WebMSX is used for in-browser MSX1 emulation; no copyrighted MSX BIOS is
included. The upstream WebMSX repository does not ship a root license file;
this notice records the source and the C-BIOS license terms.
